  "code_revision": "The model card's own Jev-style decision API block ran unmodified (README serving block SHA256 bf3d0336b74da40b1f4f908eef7b9a6bed3a160a28d694320e5044160fa367c1). Native probabilities with no response shim or instruction conversion. gliclass 0.1.21, decoder-kv architecture, DecoderKVZeroShotClassificationPipeline; maximum joint input 32,768 tokens, no truncation, bf16 on one CUDA device, no quantisation. torch 2.14.0, transformers 5.20.0, tokenizers 0.23.3. Pure torch Qwen3.5 GatedDeltaNet path; no custom kernels. A first-party wrapper adds only a health route. Source and pinned safetensors weights ran on isolated rented hardware with read-only mounts, no credentials and networking disabled. The scored process was fresh.",
